{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Publish the result only after MDC restoration succeeds.** This completes the caller\u2019s future even when `restore.close()` throws, so an asynchronous JVM-fatal failure only kills the worker while the invocation caller can receive success/PENDING; inline nonfatal failures are also discarded and may leave MDC corrupted. Complete the result exceptionally for restoration failures, rethrow JVM-fatal failures on the worker, and use a reliable clear fallback for ordinary failures.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77qp-v","finding_digest":"d43371534e39ba8ef3db8885e66b122c9182a4cc77f87519192245519be87d31","finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","line":304,"observation_digest":"f27702046cefd31cb28fbd24882b0e65e5abb4729a82fc10677408450896f0fd","observation_id":"aro_v1_6j3qebdm57jrzmupxusiqkyomx","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","published_at":"2026-10-08T17:41:36Z","review_id":"arr_v1_w4f4vfmlkvk6yuwzqbo6rmxwrf","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"6c590162ee0e40cbba600285b7fafbadc0457c8e","reviewer":"codex","start_line":304,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_3vccvfyx6qqdmdytiikw3dg3op","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T17:41:36Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
